<title>EGYPT: Egypt pound overnight, one-week rates fall.</title>
<headline>Egypt pound overnight, one-week rates fall.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Overnight and one-week interbank rates on the Egyptian pound fell in the private sector market on Monday, bankers said.</p>
<p>Overnight rates ranged between 10 and 10 1/8 against Sunday's 10 1/4 percent.</p>
<p>One-week rates were 10 1/4 from 10 3/8 and 10 7/16 percent on Sunday.</p>
<p>Public-sector banks maintained their minimum overnight lending rate at 10 1/2 percent.</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +202 578 3290/1</p>
</text>
